# Help! Help! (levels/toybox/helper.txt). Stop to hear him call; up to his rope: he drops
# Nat ("OOPS!"); again: he flings him over the brushes. On to the second helper: a fling,
# back the way he came; again: the honest one, up onto the plateau. Along it (two hops over
# the brushes), down to the shore, a jump over the sewage to the third helper's rope: up
# and onto the goal's ledge.
